    },
    "primary_membership": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "dates": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 2,
      "maxItems": 2,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"
      }
    },
    "slots": {
      "const": [
        "pre_2",
        "post"
      ]
    },
    "completed_at": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "source_sha256": {
      "type": "object",
      "minProperties": 1,
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
      }
    }
  },
  "description": "Attachment only to existing914floodtestcases. Each condition/seed is a saved historical parsed answer, not a vote/confidence/new inference. null means saved parse failure; missing condition/seed is invalid. source_gold/question_id/dates/slots must equal the existing case and frozen source item. primary_membership must equal frozen E5 eval_sets primary_same_prompt and existing C1 supported_stratum. completed_at requires an explicit timezone. full/full_no_delta is an evaluation intervention of the trained full model. Validation also checks audited byte hashes and full26325prediction coverage; JSON Schema alone cannot establish provenance."
}
